为她吗。“小姐，连二夫人都被叫去了，小姐的双腿无法行动，这……香儿一个人也搬不动啊。”沉香说着皱着一张脸，都快急哭了。“急什么，等着。”蓝雅闭上眼睛，凳子搬到门都费劲，更别说是大厅了。若那些人真想见她，必然会派人来传达，如今做的也只有等，等不来正好，她乐得清闲。大约十分钟过去了，耳边传来脚步声，蓝雅不以为意，沉香心情七上八下的，如今的小姐变化太大了，拿不准小姐的心思，她也不敢贸然行事。“二小姐，老爷放你去大厅，你这也快一点啊，老爷大小姐都等得不耐烦了。”门外传来老妈子的不耐烦的声音，嘲讽的味道浓烈：“你这身子就算是再娇贵，也不能让大家都等着吧。”沉香愤愤不平，若是以前她们才不敢如此对待小姐呢。“沉香去开门。”蓝雅将手中的书籍朝着床上一扔，自然知道这些个老婆子狐假虎威。打开门，三个四十多岁的老婆子大摇大摆的走了进来，嘲讽的看了一眼蓝雅：“吆，二小姐打扮的那么漂亮，莫不成想**狂王不成？还是说想去勾起其他男人？”蓝雅抬眼望着三个欧巴桑，嘴巴倒是狠毒，专门踩别人的痛楚。“你们胡说什么，小心我撕烂你们的嘴。”沉香上前指着老婆子们，咬牙切齿。老婆子冷哼一声：“就凭你？我一根小手指都能将你压死。”“你……”沉香反驳的话还没说出口，转眼迎上蓝雅警告的眼神，识相的闭上嘴巴。“二小姐，你以为如今还像以前一样，告诉你，收起那一套，今后谁踩着谁还不知道呢，现在称你一声二小姐，明天你就得称我一声姑奶奶！”见沉香不反驳，那老婆子更加得意。“若不想死就给我闭嘴！”蓝雅冷下声音，她的忍耐是有限度的。“闭嘴？”老婆子笑了：“我的二小姐，在这个你如今连一只狗都不如，还想让我闭嘴？”她们在府里服侍了几十年，自然懂得生存的一切技巧，对于得宠的，她们恭恭敬敬的供着，对于失去位置的，她们就会再多踩上一脚，早死早超生。蓝雅不紧不慢顺手抄了一个杯子，朝着老婆子的脑袋直奔而去。“碰。”“啊……我的脑袋。”老婆子眼前一花，额头一疼，立马抬手捂着脑门，一个**顺着手指落在地上：“啊……血，流血了，好你个贱人，我要杀了你！”", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/shenyiqifei/9.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "She has a strong resistance to the attack and is covered in medicine. Her muscles and blood are much stronger than ordinary people because they have been trained by medicine since she was a child. There is still hope for her to be able to be taken back. \"Miss, miss.\" Chen Xiang panted and ran in from the yard. \"What's wrong?\" Lanya looked away from her legs. \"Miss, the master is back and said... He told the lady to go to the lobby.\" Chen Xiang had a troubled face, and she was a little scared. \"Go to the lobby?\" Lan Ya sneered in her heart. Mu Zhihang and Mu Yueqing went out to inspect the business. They probably came back after hearing about her. They asked her to go to the lobby. Her legs were like this, so it was clear that they were going to make things difficult for her. \"Miss, even the Second Madam has been called. Miss's legs can't move. This... Xiang'er can't move by herself.\" Chen Xiang said with a wrinkled face, almost crying. \"What's the rush? Just wait.\" Lanya closed her eyes. It was difficult to move the stool to the door, let alone the hall. If those people really want to see her, they will definitely send someone to tell them. Now all they can do is wait. If they can't wait, she will be happy and free. About ten minutes passed, and the sound of footsteps came to her ears. Lan Ya didn't take it seriously. Chenxiang was in a state of confusion. The young lady has changed too much now. She couldn't be sure of the young lady's thoughts, so she didn't dare to act rashly. \"Second Miss, I'll let you go to the hall. You should hurry up. I'm impatient to wait.\" The old woman's impatient voice came from outside the door, with a strong sense of ridicule: \"No matter how delicate your body is, you can't let everyone wait.\" Chen Xiang was indignant. If they had not dared to treat the young lady like this before. \"Agarwood, go and open the door.\" Lanya threw the book in her hand towards the bed, knowing that these old women were pretending to be powerful. Opening the door, three old women in their forties walked in swaggeringly. They glanced at Lanya mockingly: \"Hey, the second lady is so beautifully dressed. Could it be that she wants to seduce the mad king? Or is she trying to seduce other men?\" Lanya raised her eyes and looked at the three Obasans, but her mouth was vicious, specializing in stomping on other people's pain. \"What nonsense are you talking about, or I'll tear your mouths apart.\" Chen Xiang stepped forward and pointed at the old ladies, gritting his teeth. The old woman snorted coldly: \"Only you? I can crush you to death with just one little finger of mine.\" \"You...\" Before Chen Xiang could utter her retort, she met Lan Ya's warning eyes in the blink of an eye and closed her mouth knowingly. \"Second Miss, do you think it's still the same as before? Let me tell you, put it away. You don't know who will step on who in the future. Now I call you Second Miss, and tomorrow you have to call me Auntie!\" Seeing that Chen Xiang didn't refute, the old woman became even more proud. \"If you don't want to die, just shut up!\" Lan Ya said coldly, her patience had its limits. \"Shut up?\" The old woman smiled: \"My second young lady, you are worse than a dog in this place, and you still want me to shut up?\" They have served in the house for decades, and they naturally know all the skills of survival. For those who are favored, they will respectfully support them, and for those who have lost their position, they will step on them one more time, causing early death and early rebirth. Lanya calmly grabbed a cup and headed straight for the old woman's head. \"Touch.\" \"Ah... my head.\" The old woman's eyes blurred and her forehead hurt. She immediately raised her hand to cover her forehead, and a piece of blood fell on the ground along her fingers: \"Ah... blood, it's bleeding, you bitch, I'm going to kill you!\"", "title_en": "Chapter 9"}